OL,3,ACrimean Bridge partly collapses as
OL,4,AZelensky hails 'unprecedented' attack
OL,5,Aby Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine has severely damaged a critical
OL,8,Fbridge linking Russia to occupied
OL,9,FCrimea, in what Volodymyr Zelensky says
OL,10,Fwas an "unprecedented operation" weeks
OL,11,Fin the making.
OL,13,FImages shared by Ukrainian officials
OL,14,Fshow a section of the Crimean Bridge -
OL,15,Falso known as the Kerch Bridge - has
OL,16,Fcollapsed into the water, dealing a
OL,17,Flogistical and symbolic blow to
OL,18,FRussia's war effort.
OL,20,FA Kremlin spokesperson insisted the
OL,21,Fbridge would be rebuilt "better than
OL,22,Fbefore".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
