OL,3,ACrimean Bridge partly collapses as
OL,4,AZelensky hails 'unprecedented' attack
OL,5,Aby Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere, Kyiv Mayor Vitali Klitschko
OL,8,Fsaid the Northern and Southern bridges,
OL,9,Fboth important crossings over the
OL,10,FDnipro River, were closed after Russia
OL,11,Ftargeted the Ukrainian capital
OL,12,Fovernight.
